{"lang":"sw","dir":"ltr","text":{"credits.donateTitle":"Saidia kujifunza kuendelee kuwa bure","credits.donateButton":"Saidia AOSSIE","credits.data":"Data","credits.photos":"Picha za miji mikuu","credits.otherPhotos":"Picha za matunda, wanyama na madini","madeBy":"imetengenezwa na"},"html":{"credits.lead":"Memo ni programu huria na ya bure kutoka <a href=\"https://aossie.org/\">AOSSIE</a>.","credits.source":"Msimbo chanzo: <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame\">github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame</a>.","credits.donateText":"AOSSIE ni shirika lisilo la faida. Memo haina matangazo, haina usajili wa kulipia na haikusanyi data yako kamwe — na tunataka iendelee kuwa hivyo kwa kila mtoto, kila mahali. Ikiwa Memo imewafanya watoto wako wawe na hamu ya kujua kuhusu dunia, tafadhali fikiria kutununulia kikombe cha kahawa: kila mchango, hata ukiwa mdogo kiasi gani, hutusaidia kutengeneza na kudumisha programu zaidi za elimu za bure. Michango ya msimbo, mawazo, tafsiri na maoni inakaribishwa vilevile!","credits.shapes":"Picha za maumbo: zimechorwa kwa ajili ya Memo, ni huru kutumia kama sehemu nyingine za programu.","credits.photoSets":"Picha za matunda, wanyama na madini: kutoka <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, zilizochaguliwa kupitia <a href=\"https://www.wikipedia.org/\">Wikipedia</a> na <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a>; majina yake katika kila lugha: <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a> (CC0).","credits.flags":"Bendera: kutoka <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/FlagQuiz\">Flag Quiz</a>, inayozichukua kutoka <a href=\"https://github.com/hampusborgos/country-flags\">hampusborgos/country-flags</a> (kikoa cha umma).","credits.capitals":"Miji mikuu na picha zake: kutoka <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/FlagQuiz\">Flag Quiz</a>, inayozichukua kutoka <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a> (CC0) na <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\">Wikimedia Commons</a>."